      "content": "hey im type 1 and my blood sugar is tanking like im shaking super bad and feeling really confused. i think im going low. what's the fastest way to fix this?? also i have some extra insulin here, should i take a little bit now so i dont crash too hard later or spike too much? im kinda scared",
